Begin ownership verification for the given target.

Currently rdap_match is the only supported method. The response
includes the proof ID and the current status (pending|verified|
failed). Scans cannot run against an unverified target.

Usage:
  usulnet recon target verify <id> [flags]

Examples:
  usulnet recon target verify 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111

Flags:
  -h, --help   help for verify

Global Flags:
  -c, --config string   config file path (default: /etc/usulnet/config.yaml or ./config.yaml)
      --json            shortcut for --output json (overrides --output)
      --output string   output format: table|json|yaml (default "table")
  -q, --quiet           suppress informational output (errors and primary data still print)
      --server string   usulnet API URL (default $USULNET_API_URL)
      --token string    API token (default $USULNET_API_TOKEN)
